  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: Takes poison damage at the start of each turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: Acid strips armor each turn, then damages health once armor is gone. Washed off by Wet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Reduces Speed by 1 while active.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: Takes fire damage each turn. Doubled if Flammable. Extinguished by Wet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: Soaked. Cancels Burning on contact. Washed off by Corroding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: Immune to Burning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: Doubles lava strike power and Burning damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: When hit while alive, applies a substance back at the attacker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: While blood is dominant, grows one Blood volume unit each turn if under capacity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: Heals when drinking blood from puddles, retorts, or blood tips struck in melee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: Immune to Poisoned. Melee applies Poisoned. Poison puddles cost nothing to path through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: Hunts rats as prey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: Hunts cats as prey.
    m_Metadata:
